{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24452","headline":"天寒晚起引酌咏怀寄许州王尚书汝州李常侍 · 白居易","name":"天寒晚起引酌咏怀寄许州王尚书汝州李常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叶覆冰池雪满山，日高慵起未开关。\n寒来更亦无过醉，老後何由可得闲。\n四海故交唯许汝，十年贫健是樊蛮。\n相思莫忘樱桃会，一放狂歌一破颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}